Today I arrive at the office a little late.
First, I take off my jacket.
I hang the jacket up.
Then I go to my desk.
My colleague Jonas is already there.
"Good morning, Jonas!" I say cheerfully.
"Morning, Maya," he answers.
"Is everything good with you?" Jonas asks.
"Yes, the U-Bahn was unfortunately already gone," I say.
Jonas nods.
I sit down on my chair.
I open my backpack.
I unpack the laptop.
Then I open the laptop.
First, I read my emails.
Then I start my work.
